--
-- 20261113000200 held decks to 12 questions (8 for Deep Conversations) and took the extras out,
-- leaving Plus at 479 playable questions and the Premium-inclusive total at 1,831, under what the
-- plans promise. 19 new decks bring them back: 4 Plus decks of 8 (32), and 15 Premium decks, five
-- Deep Conversations of 8 and ten others of 11 (150). Plus 511, Premium 2,013.
--
-- Several lean into what Twofold is for, distance and flights, which the catalogue had little of.
-- Every question was checked against all existing ones for repeats, in wording and, for trivia,
-- by answer: a question whose answer matches an existing one with overlapping wording is the same
-- fact asked again.
--
-- That answer check also caught seven questions from 20261113000100, already live, that repeat an
-- existing fact in other words. They are rewritten in place below, so their decks keep their size.


